<!--
  Hand-trimmed fixture standing in for WindowsServer-2025-MS-1.1, sibling of
  WindowsServer-2025-DC-1.1. Values copied from real processed data in the local PowerStig
  clone. AuditPolicy, AuditSetting, Document, Manual, Permission, Registry, RootCertificate,
  SecurityOption and WindowsFeature carry the exact same real rule ids and values DC-1.1 does -
  verified identical field for field between the two products before reuse here - so only
  AccountPolicy and UserRight, whose MS content genuinely differs from DC's, are picked fresh.

  V-278184 is a real organisation-value UserRight rule whose Identity PowerStig leaves empty and
  whose Force is False, a shape DC's fixture UserRight rule (Force True, three fixed identities)
  does not cover.
-->
